{
  "uid": "venue-environments",
  "title": "Environments",
  "description": "Every venue environment in this cluster at once: which are up, when each was live, how they were sized and what they are using. Drawn from the core's scrape rather than from namespaces, so an environment appears when it starts answering and disappears when it is reaped.",
  "tags": [
    "venue",
    "system"
  ],
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "timezone": "utc",
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-2d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "links": [],
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "refresh": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "logs",
        "label": "Loki",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "loki",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "refresh": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "env",
        "label": "Environment",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(up{component=\"core\"}, env)",
          "refId": "env"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(up{component=\"core\"}, env)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "allValue": ".*"
      },
      {
        "name": "namespace",
        "label": "Namespace",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(up{component=\"core\", env=~\"$env\"}, namespace)",
          "refId": "namespace"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(up{component=\"core\", env=~\"$env\"}, namespace)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "allValue": ".*"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Which environments exist, and when they existed",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "When each environment was live",
      "description": "One row per environment, drawn from its core's scrape. **A gap is the answer, not missing data**: the row starts when the core first answered a scrape and ends when the target went away, which for a preview is when the reaper took it (36 hours from the last push, deploy/argocd/reaper.yaml) and the namespace cleanup removed what was left. Red means the environment was still there but its core could not be scraped.\n\nNothing is drawn from before Prometheus's retention window, and an environment it has forgotten looks exactly like one it never saw \u2014 see deploy/observability/values/prometheus-history.yaml.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 0,
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "unreachable",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 1
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "live",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "noValue": "\u2014"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mergeValues": true,
        "showValue": "never",
        "alignValue": "left",
        "rowHeight": 0.9,
        "perPage": 20,
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (env, namespace) (up{component=\"core\", env=~\"$env\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{env}} \u00b7 {{namespace}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Environments now, and what they are using",
      "description": "One row per environment that is up. `profile` and `capacity` are what it was sized as: previews default to the small engine, and a pull request labelled `env-throughput` gets `launch` with the memory to match (deploy/argocd/applicationset.yaml). \"asked\" is the sum of the pods' requests \u2014 what the environment reserves on the node whether it uses it or not, and so what decides how many fit.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "memory used"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "bytes"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "memory asked"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "bytes"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "namespace age"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "s"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "CPU used"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "short"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "CPU asked"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "short"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 3
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "env",
            "desc": false
          }
        ]
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "joinByField",
          "options": {
            "byField": "namespace",
            "mode": "outer"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "up": true,
              "build": true,
              "Time 1": true,
              "Time 2": true,
              "Time 3": true,
              "Time 4": true,
              "Time 5": true,
              "Time 6": true,
              "Time 7": true,
              "Time 8": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value #A": "up",
              "Value #B": "build",
              "Value #C": "pods",
              "Value #D": "CPU used",
              "Value #E": "CPU asked",
              "Value #F": "memory used",
              "Value #G": "memory asked",
              "Value #H": "namespace age"
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "env": 0,
              "namespace": 1,
              "profile": 2,
              "capacity": 3,
              "version": 4,
              "pods": 5,
              "CPU used": 6,
              "CPU asked": 7,
              "memory used": 8,
              "memory asked": 9,
              "namespace age": 10
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (env, namespace, profile) (up{component=\"core\", env=~\"$env\"})",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "max by (namespace, capacity, version) (venue_node_build_info) and on (namespace) group by (namespace) (up{component=\"core\", env=~\"$env\"})",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "count by (namespace) (kube_pod_info) and on (namespace) group by (namespace) (up{component=\"core\", env=~\"$env\"})",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "expr": "sum by (namespace) (rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{container!=\"\", container!=\"POD\"}[$__rate_interval])) and on (namespace) group by (namespace) (up{component=\"core\", env=~\"$env\"})",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "E",
          "expr": "sum by (namespace) (kube_pod_container_resource_requests{resource=\"cpu\"}) and on (namespace) group by (namespace) (up{component=\"core\", env=~\"$env\"})",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "F",
          "expr": "sum by (namespace) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{container!=\"\", container!=\"POD\"}) and on (namespace) group by (namespace) (up{component=\"core\", env=~\"$env\"})",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "G",
          "expr": "sum by (namespace) (kube_pod_container_resource_requests{resource=\"memory\"}) and on (namespace) group by (namespace) (up{component=\"core\", env=~\"$env\"})",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "H",
          "expr": "(time() - max by (namespace) (kube_namespace_created)) and on (namespace) group by (namespace) (up{component=\"core\", env=~\"$env\"})",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "What they are costing the node",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU by environment",
      "description": "Cores actually burnt, summed over every container in the environment's namespace.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (namespace) (rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{container!=\"\", container!=\"POD\"}[$__rate_interval])) and on (namespace) group by (namespace) (up{component=\"core\", env=~\"$env\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{namespace}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": 5,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Memory by environment",
      "description": "Working set, summed over every container in the environment's namespace.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (namespace) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{container!=\"\", container!=\"POD\"}) and on (namespace) group by (namespace) (up{component=\"core\", env=~\"$env\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{namespace}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": 6,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 19
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Pods by environment",
      "description": "How many pods each environment is running. A line that falls to nothing is an environment going away; one that steps up is a profile that turned the observer or the FIX adapter on.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "count by (namespace) (kube_pod_info) and on (namespace) group by (namespace) (up{component=\"core\", env=~\"$env\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{namespace}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": 7,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU reserved against the node",
      "description": "What the environments together have asked for, against what the node has to give. Previews are what fills this up: when the sum approaches the line, the next pull request's environment has nowhere to be scheduled.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum (kube_pod_container_resource_requests{resource=\"cpu\"} and on (namespace) group by (namespace) (up{component=\"core\", env=~\"$env\"}))",
          "legendFormat": "asked for by environments",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum (kube_node_status_allocatable{resource=\"cpu\"})",
          "legendFormat": "the node has",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": 8,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 27
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Leftovers",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "id": 9,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 35
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Preview namespaces with no venue in them",
      "description": "A preview namespace that is still there with nothing running in it. Ordinarily empty: ArgoCD prunes the workload and the cleanup CronJob takes the namespace once no Application owns it (deploy/argocd/namespace-cleanup.yaml, every ten minutes). A row that stays here for longer than that is worth looking at \u2014 each one holds a copy of the registry pull secret.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "namespace age"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "s"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "namespace age",
            "desc": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "joinByField",
          "options": {
            "byField": "namespace",
            "mode": "outer"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Time 1": true,
              "Time 2": true,
              "Value #A": true,
              "phase": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value #B": "namespace age"
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "namespace": 0,
              "namespace age": 1
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "group by (namespace) (kube_namespace_status_phase{namespace=~\"venue-pr-.*\", phase=\"Active\"}) unless on (namespace) group by (namespace) (up{component=\"core\"})",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "(time() - max by (namespace) (kube_namespace_created)) and on (namespace) (group by (namespace) (kube_namespace_status_phase{namespace=~\"venue-pr-.*\", phase=\"Active\"}) unless on (namespace) group by (namespace) (up{component=\"core\"}))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "id": 10,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 36
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Complaints, every environment at once",
      "description": "Lines from any environment that read like something went wrong, newest first.\n\nMatched by what the line says rather than by a severity label, because there isn't one to match: the venue's components log plain text as well as JSON, so `| json | level=~\"...\"` would quietly drop every line that is not an object \u2014 which here is most of them. A line filter reads both. It also means this is a net, not a classifier: it will catch a line that merely contains the word, and a real problem phrased without any of these words will not appear.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${logs}"
      },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": false,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "sortOrder": "Descending"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${logs}"
          },
          "expr": "{app=\"venue-mini\", namespace=~\"$namespace\"} |~ \"(?i)(warn|error|refused|panic|fatal)\"",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "id": 11,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 36
      }
    }
  ]
}
